      "type": "text",
      "text": "Weather panel  \u2192  moisture state  \u2192  p(dry spell)  \u2192  condition_code  \u2192  JOIN approved DACP rule  \u2192  advisory or ABSTAIN     \u00b7     services/trigger-engine     \u00b7     never creates a rule",
      "originalText": "Weather panel  \u2192  moisture state  \u2192  p(dry spell)  \u2192  condition_code  \u2192  JOIN approved DACP rule  \u2192  advisory or ABSTAIN     \u00b7     services/trigger-engine     \u00b7     never creates a rule",
