      "type": "text",
      "text": "M2  physics  \u00b7  FAO-56 water-balance bucket\nNot learned. Parameters only. RMSE vs ERA5-Land (when real soil lands).\nwaterbalance.py  \u00b7  S_t = clamp(S_{t-1} + P_eff \u2212 ET_c, 0, AWC)",
      "originalText": "M2  physics  \u00b7  FAO-56 water-balance bucket\nNot learned. Parameters only. RMSE vs ERA5-Land (when real soil lands).\nwaterbalance.py  \u00b7  S_t = clamp(S_{t-1} + P_eff \u2212 ET_c, 0, AWC)",
