      "type": "text",
      "text": "M3  decision  \u00b7  cost\u2013loss + hysteresis\nNo learning. Act when p > \u03b1 = C/L.  SMS must not double-fire.\ndecision.py  \u00b7  default action is ABSTAIN",
      "originalText": "M3  decision  \u00b7  cost\u2013loss + hysteresis\nNo learning. Act when p > \u03b1 = C/L.  SMS must not double-fire.\ndecision.py  \u00b7  default action is ABSTAIN",
