      "type": "text",
      "text": "NOT BUILT  \u00b7  real adapters (S1\u2013S2)\nIMD gridded rain  \u00b7  ECMWF ensembles / S2S reforecasts  \u00b7  ERA5-Land\nENSO (ONI) / IOD / MJO  \u00b7  grid \u2192 block area-weighted spatial join\nReforecast access is the go/no-go for training M1 on real weather",
      "originalText": "NOT BUILT  \u00b7  real adapters (S1\u2013S2)\nIMD gridded rain  \u00b7  ECMWF ensembles / S2S reforecasts  \u00b7  ERA5-Land\nENSO (ONI) / IOD / MJO  \u00b7  grid \u2192 block area-weighted spatial join\nReforecast access is the go/no-go for training M1 on real weather",
