      "type": "text",
      "text": "S3  preprocess.py\n\nsort + dedup  \u00b7  asfreq('D') with explicit NaN\nRain: NEVER ffill / NEVER zero-fill  \u2192  mask + flag\nT: interpolate \u2264 3d    SM: ffill \u2264 2d\nRain cap = 1000 mm (plausibility, not 4\u03c3 clip)",
      "originalText": "S3  preprocess.py\n\nsort + dedup  \u00b7  asfreq('D') with explicit NaN\nRain: NEVER ffill / NEVER zero-fill  \u2192  mask + flag\nT: interpolate \u2264 3d    SM: ffill \u2264 2d\nRain cap = 1000 mm (plausibility, not 4\u03c3 clip)",
