      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "MoistureState  (ankur_schemas.condition)  \u2014  observed physics, no probability inside\n\nsoil_moisture_fraction   consecutive_dry_days   rain_3d_mm / rain_3d_normal_mm\ndays_since_sowing  \u2014  NEVER inferred (farmer-declared or calendar; missing \u2192 those conditions cannot fire)\nonset_delay_days  \u2014  only IMD declares onset; None is not evidence of delay\n\nThis state alone drives condition detection. A high p cannot invent a dry spell that the bucket did not see.",
      "originalText": "MoistureState  (ankur_schemas.condition)  \u2014  observed physics, no probability inside\n\nsoil_moisture_fraction   consecutive_dry_days   rain_3d_mm / rain_3d_normal_mm\ndays_since_sowing  \u2014  NEVER inferred (farmer-declared or calendar; missing \u2192 those conditions cannot fire)\nonset_delay_days  \u2014  only IMD declares onset; None is not evidence of delay\n\nThis state alone drives condition detection. A high p cannot invent a dry spell that the bucket did not see.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
