      "text": "S8  models.py  ladder  (simple \u2192 complex)\n\nB0 climatology (BSS denominator)     B1 persistence (expected to lose)\nB2 raw ensemble fraction  \u2190  the bar that decides if ML adds anything\nM1a extended logistic (Wilks)        M1c HGB + monotonic constraints\nM1d isotonic recalibration on out-of-fold preds only",
