      "type": "text",
      "text": "S9  evaluation.py     Brier  \u00b7  BSS vs climatology  \u00b7  reliability + ECE  \u00b7  sharpness  \u00b7  ROC-AUC  \u00b7  Richardson value V(\u03b1) across the full \u03b1 range     block-bootstrap 95% CI on BSS     never a bare point estimate     effective n \u2248 40 seasons \u00d7 ~3 events \u2248 120  (not 34,000 block-days)",
      "originalText": "S9  evaluation.py     Brier  \u00b7  BSS vs climatology  \u00b7  reliability + ECE  \u00b7  sharpness  \u00b7  ROC-AUC  \u00b7  Richardson value V(\u03b1) across the full \u03b1 range     block-bootstrap 95% CI on BSS     never a bare point estimate     effective n \u2248 40 seasons \u00d7 ~3 events \u2248 120  (not 34,000 block-days)",
