      "type": "text",
      "text": "S11  conditions.py\ndetect_condition(MoistureState)\nfirst match wins, most specific first\n\nDRY_SPELL_AFTER_SOWING\nDELAYED_ONSET  (> 3 weeks)\nUNSEASONAL_RAIN  (3\u00d7 pentad normal)\nTERMINAL_DROUGHT  (\u2265 DOY 250)\nMID_SEASON_DRY_SPELL  (catch-all)\nelse  None  \u2014  most days, correctly",
      "originalText": "S11  conditions.py\ndetect_condition(MoistureState)\nfirst match wins, most specific first\n\nDRY_SPELL_AFTER_SOWING\nDELAYED_ONSET  (> 3 weeks)\nUNSEASONAL_RAIN  (3\u00d7 pentad normal)\nTERMINAL_DROUGHT  (\u2265 DOY 250)\nMID_SEASON_DRY_SPELL  (catch-all)\nelse  None  \u2014  most days, correctly",
