      "type": "text",
      "text": "JOIN  extracted_rules\n\nWHERE review_status = approved\n  AND citation valid\n  AND condition_code = detected\n\nConfidence is NOT re-checked\nis_advisory_eligible() already exists\nExtractor and trigger never import\neach other \u2014 they meet only here",
      "originalText": "JOIN  extracted_rules\n\nWHERE review_status = approved\n  AND citation valid\n  AND condition_code = detected\n\nConfidence is NOT re-checked\nis_advisory_eligible() already exists\nExtractor and trigger never import\neach other \u2014 they meet only here",
