      "type": "text",
      "text": "can_emit_advisory()  [domain policy]\nDefault answer is NO\n\n1. a condition was detected\n2. code is emittable (not UNMAPPED)\n3. matched rule is approved + cited\n4. rule.condition_code == detected\n\nAny miss \u2192 ABSTAIN + logged reason",
      "originalText": "can_emit_advisory()  [domain policy]\nDefault answer is NO\n\n1. a condition was detected\n2. code is emittable (not UNMAPPED)\n3. matched rule is approved + cited\n4. rule.condition_code == detected\n\nAny miss \u2192 ABSTAIN + logged reason",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el_594574",
