      "type": "text",
      "text": "S10  decision.py   [M3]\nOnly runs if every gate passed\n\np* = \u03b1 = C/L   (farmer's economics)\nnot sown + p > \u03b1  \u2192  WAIT\nsown   + p > \u03b1  \u2192  RE_SOW\np \u2264 \u03b1            \u2192  SOW / silence\n\nhysteresis: 2 consecutive cycles\nbefore advice is allowed to change",
      "originalText": "S10  decision.py   [M3]\nOnly runs if every gate passed\n\np* = \u03b1 = C/L   (farmer's economics)\nnot sown + p > \u03b1  \u2192  WAIT\nsown   + p > \u03b1  \u2192  RE_SOW\np \u2264 \u03b1            \u2192  SOW / silence\n\nhysteresis: 2 consecutive cycles\nbefore advice is allowed to change",
      "fontSize": 14,
