      "type": "text",
      "text": "ABSTAIN  (the default, and the most common output)\nPlan is silent, forecast unusable, sowing anchor missing,\nrule unapproved, or citation fails. Logged with the reason.\nSilent if the plan is silent \u2014 enforced in ML, not just UI.",
      "originalText": "ABSTAIN  (the default, and the most common output)\nPlan is silent, forecast unusable, sowing anchor missing,\nrule unapproved, or citation fails. Logged with the reason.\nSilent if the plan is silent \u2014 enforced in ML, not just UI.",
