      "type": "text",
      "text": "WAIT / SOW / RE_SOW  +  matched DACPRule\nAction shape from decision.py; variety, seed rate, wording\nfrom the cited government row. GET /rules/{id}/citation answers why.\nseed_demand_quintals()  \u2014  BAO stocking (needs seed_rate from the rule).",
      "originalText": "WAIT / SOW / RE_SOW  +  matched DACPRule\nAction shape from decision.py; variety, seed rate, wording\nfrom the cited government row. GET /rules/{id}/citation answers why.\nseed_demand_quintals()  \u2014  BAO stocking (needs seed_rate from the rule).",
